Package: com.itsallexb.safariscale.debug
Name: SafariScale Debug (dev only)
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Development tool for SafariScale: runs /tmp/ssdebug.js in Safari's visible page when com.itsallexb.safariscale.debug/run is posted and writes the result to /tmp/ssdebug.out. Not for normal use.
Maintainer: itsAllexB
Author: itsAllexB
Section: Development
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 8.0)
